  "stem": "A company rents vans for \\$45 per day plus \\$0.30 per kilometer driven. Nadia rented a van for 3 days, and her total charge was \\$210. How many kilometers did Nadia drive?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "250"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "The daily charges are \\(3 \\cdot 45 = 135\\) dollars.",
    "Let \\(k\\) be the kilometers driven: \\(135 + 0.30k = 210\\).",
    "So \\(0.30k = 75\\) and \\(k = 250\\)."
  ],
